I'm now revising the exclusion logic based on the prompt. I'm focusing on handling for-sale website redirects, ensuring I remove the parked URLs while keeping the lead if a valid LinkedIn or email exists. I'll update the code and add a log message for debugging. The primary concern is now the precise interaction of all components and ensuring the removal of the specific for-sale URL is performed correctly.

