I've just increased the timeout for `checkUrlExists` to 5 seconds to reduce false positives due to slow responses. This should allow more time for potentially valid sites and LinkedIn pages to respond. The existing exclusion logic is correctly implemented, so the implementation is preserved.  I am confident that increasing the timeout will improve the robustness.


